WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.788
Lean found unreported

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.673
bugs in Clojure's

00:00:02.484 --> 00:00:03.026
core

00:00:03.558 --> 00:00:04.548
The author checked

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.706
Clojure version 1.12.7

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:09.489
released on November 18, 2026

00:00:09.619 --> 00:00:11.364
using JDK 21

00:00:11.258 --> 00:00:11.930
and the Lean

00:00:11.742 --> 00:00:12.732
theorem prover

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.189
One bug hid

00:00:14.001 --> 00:00:14.578
in a bit

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:15.510
mask meant to

00:00:15.322 --> 00:00:16.076
clear the low

00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:17.043
five bits and

00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:17.715
round down to

00:00:17.527 --> 00:00:18.446
a multiple of

00:00:18.258 --> 00:00:19.071
thirty-two

00:00:19.272 --> 00:00:20.321
it also cleared

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:21.324
bit sixteen and

00:00:21.265 --> 00:00:22.373
everything above it

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:23.676
With the fix

00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:24.207
in place

00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:25.138
Lean proved the

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:26.023
check matches the

00:00:25.835 --> 00:00:27.273
naive specification

00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:28.535
for every thirty-two-bit

00:00:28.346 --> 00:00:28.971
input

00:00:29.502 --> 00:00:30.516
Full story on

00:00:30.327 --> 00:00:31.223
the dashboard
